{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-post-template-tsx","path":"/crabstick/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"47b831a9-5c7f-5312-a066-b0cc053ccbfe","html":"<p>一根木棍儿</p>\n<hr>\n<p>当过几年的留守儿童</p>\n<p>那会儿我爸在外地贩粮为了让我在家听我奶奶的话</p>\n<p>给了我奶奶一根木棍</p>\n<p>如果我惹我奶奶生气一次，我奶奶就在木棍上刻下一道痕</p>\n<p>如果不超过三条痕 回来就给我奖励</p>\n<p>最初的一个月</p>\n<p>我的表现和外表一样老实</p>\n<p>后来内心跳脱的本心没有按捺住</p>\n<p>木棍的刻痕逐渐从 0 到 3 的时候</p>\n<p>已经决定完全放飞自我</p>\n<p>一次激烈的叛逆声在奶奶面前疯狂的叫嚣</p>\n<p>然后走出家门</p>\n<p>气的奶奶把整根木棍剁了个稀碎</p>","fields":{"slug":"/posts//crabstick","tagSlugs":["/tag/misc/"]},"frontmatter":{"date":"2021-06-24T00:00:00.000Z","description":null,"tags":["Misc"],"title":"木棍","by":null,"cover":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":2.4,"src":"/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/dd377/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg","srcSet":"/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/17f4c/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg 300w,\n/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/d8967/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg 600w,\n/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/dd377/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg 1200w,\n/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/ba7f6/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg 1800w,\n/static/33996f9491bbe0b7817031e467f796cd/b349f/arseny-togulev-mnx3NlXwKdg-unsplash-middle.jpg 1920w","sizes":"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px","presentationWidth":1200,"presentationHeight":500}}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts//crabstick"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2246977889","2702970128","2727970573"],"slicesMap":{}}